# Repo-root build context (see backend/Dockerfile). Keep the daemon context
# small: only backend/ + SOUL.md need to be sent. Everything below is either
# irrelevant to the image or must never ship in it.
frontend/
**/node_modules
.git
backend/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/data
backend/memory
**/*.db
docs/
.claude/
.env
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Docs and stray Markdown are not needed in the image — but SOUL.md is ARIA's
# runtime identity and MUST remain copyable.
*.md
!SOUL.md
